{"ts": 0.041273, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;208mSHELLTUTOR\u001b[0m  —  a vimtutor prerequisite course\r\n\r\nWelcome. A short hands-on course in \u001b[1;38;5;244mfive stages\u001b[0m that\r\nprepare you for \u001b[1;38;5;220mvimtutor\u001b[0m. About 45 to 60 minutes total.\r\n\r\nEach stage is a few short lessons followed by a small task. Pass the\r\ntask to advance. Retry as much as you like — no time pressure, no\r\nskip.\r\n\r\nYour work happens in \u001b[38;5;109m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-8dqua7dy\u001b[0m; the tutor never writes\r\noutside that folder.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;208m▶ Type \u001b[1;38;5;220mnext\u001b[1;38;5;208m for a quick orientation.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 609}
{"ts": 0.041442, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
