{"ts": 0.080917, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;208mSTAGE 1 — Where am I?\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nFour short lessons (about 10 minutes) followed by a small task.\r\nYou'll meet the prompt, run a few simple commands, and learn the\r\nkeyboard habits that make the shell easy to live with.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;208m▶ Type \u001b[1;38;5;220mnext\u001b[1;38;5;208m to start lesson 1.1.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 312}
