{"ts": 0.294175, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;208mSTAGE 1 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;244mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[1;38;5;244mpractical task\u001b[0m: run a few commands and tell me what\r\nthey printed. The script verifies your answers.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mUnlimited retries. No skip.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 275}
